<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix A</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Example Translations from English to German (WMT’19 Dataset)</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix showcases selected English sentences from the WMT 2019 dataset along with their German translations, serving as examples to illustrate and compare the quality of outputs produced by different methods examined in this work: Random Few-Shot prompting, K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN), Adaptive Few-Shot Prompting (AFSP), and TreePrompt. For each example, we present the source English sentence, the human reference translation, and the corresponding outputs from each method. These qualitative examples complement the quantitative results discussed in the main text.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>source and reference</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">source</span> Only the dwarf tower that is still present today survived as witness of the church’s 750-year-old history.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">refrence</span> Nur der heute noch vorhandene Turmzwerg blieb als Zeuge der 750 Jahre alten Kirchengeschichte erhalten.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">source</span> Up until 1869, the Hilarius cemetery in Tumlingen served as the last place of rest for Hörschweiler’s dead.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">refrence</span>Bis 1869 diente der Tumlinger Hilarius-Friedhof auch als letzte Ruhestätte für die Toten aus Hörschweiler.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">source</span>During the 30 Years War (1616 to 1648) the window panes were smashed in and the bell ropes stolen.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">refrence</span>Im 30-jährigen Krieg (1616 bis 1648) wurden die Fensterscheiben eingeschlagen und die Glockenseile gestohlen.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">source</span>As is apparent from the upper administrative office for Freudenstadt’s description in 1858, the m̈ountainẅas, alongside the lower village and the upper village that can just about be made out still in the appearance of Tumlingen today, the village’s third, grand centre of settlement.",</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">refrence</span>Wie aus der Beschreibung des Oberamtes Freudenstadt von 1858 hervorgeht, war neben dem Unterdorf und dem Oberdorf, die heute im Ortsbild von Tumlingen gerade noch zu erkennen sind, der B̈ergd̈er dritte, der herrschaftliche Siedlungskern des Dorfes.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">source</span>Due to its idyllic setting and beautiful view over the village, the historical site of St. Hilarius is a beloved place to tarry a while.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i10.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">refrence</span>Ob seiner idyllischen Lage und schöner Aussicht auf die Ortschaft ist die historische St. Hilarius-Anlage ein beliebter Ort zum Verweilen.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Zero-shot Method Translation</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Nur der Zwergturm, der noch heute vorhanden ist, überlebte als Zeuge der 750-jährigen Geschichte der Kirche.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Bis 1869 diente der Hilarius-Friedhof in Tumlingen als letzte Ruhestätte für die Toten von Hörschweiler.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Während des Dreißigjährigen Krieges (1616 bis 1648) wurden die Fensterscheiben eingeschlagen und die Glockenseile gestohlen..</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Wie aus der Beschreibung des oberen Verwaltungsamtes für Freudenstadt von 1858 hervorgeht, war der B̈ergn̈eben dem unteren Dorf und dem oberen Dorf, das in der heutigen Erscheinung von Tumlingen noch erkennbar ist, das dritte, große Siedlungszentrum des Dorfes.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Aufgrund seiner idyllischen Lage und des schönen Ausblicks über das Dorf ist die historische Stätte von St. Hilarius ein beliebter Ort, um eine Weile zu verweilen.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
